---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Tentang Kami & Visi Misi — Konveksi Nusantara">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-luxury-800 font-semibold mb-3 block">Company Profile</span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-serif mb-6">Membangun Standar Baru Manufaktur Pakaian</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-luxury-800 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Konveksi Nusantara hadir sebagai mitra produksi pakaian high-end untuk brand lokal, instansi pemerintahan, dan perusahaan multinasional.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Visi Misi Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb-20">
            <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-luxury-200 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 text-9xl font-serif text-luxury-100 select-none pointer-events-none">01</div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif mb-4">Visi Perusahaan</h3>
                <p class="text-luxury-800 leading-relaxed font-light">Menjadi pusat manufaktur garmen dan konveksi terkemuka di Asia Tenggara yang mengedepankan inovasi teknologi jahit, kualitas tanpa kompromi, serta etika kerja berstandar global pada tahun 2030.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border border-luxury-200 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 text-9xl font-serif text-luxury-100 select-none pointer-events-none">02</div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif mb-4">Misi Utama</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-3 text-luxury-800 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-luxury-900 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Menyediakan layanan produksi custom pakaian dengan presisi jahitan butik.</li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-luxury-900 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Memberdayakan tenaga kerja lokal terlatih melalui akademi jahit internal.</li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-luxury-900 mt-2 shrink-0"></span>Menerapkan sistem manajemen transparan berbasis digital bagi setiap klien.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Workshop & Facility -->
        <div class="bg-luxury-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-10 sm:p-16 mb-20 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif mb-6">Fasilitas Workshop Berstandar Internasional</h2>
                <p class="text-luxury-200 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">Dilengkapi mesin jahit otomatis high-speed, mesin potong laser presisi tinggi, serta divisi quality control berlapis untuk memastikan setiap produk sempurna sebelum dikirim.</p>
                <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890" target="_blank" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white text-luxury-900 font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-luxury-200 transition">Jadwalkan Kunjungan Workshop</a>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800" alt="Workshop" class="w-full h-auto object-cover">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
